i, Williams, Minoia, Wimille, then Birkin who had passed Divo and then came Campari.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":11,"text":"Williams in third place had put up a record lap at 6m24s at 139.687 km/h average speed.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":11,"text":"Williams in third place had put up a record lap at 6m24s at 139.687 km/h average speed.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":22,"text":"Borzacchini took over from Nuvolari. At the same time Varzi was relieved by Chiron, topped up fuel, oil and fitted four new wheels.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":22,"text":"Borzacchini took over from Nuvolari. At the same time Varzi was relieved by Chiron, topped up fuel, oil and fitted four new wheels.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":25,"text":"Chiron chased after Borzacchini's Alfa Romeo and passed him into first place on lap 25, around 372.5 km.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":25,"text":"Chiron chased after Borzacchini's Alfa Romeo and passed him into first place on lap 25, around 372.5 km.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":28,"text":"At the beginning of the fourth hour Chiron broke the lap record at 6m22s, an average speed of 140.418 km/h.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":28,"text":"At the beginning of the fourth hour Chiron broke the lap record at 6m22s, an average speed of 140.418 km/h.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":37,"text":"During the fifth hour, on lap 37, Chiron established a new lap record in 6m19s at an average speed of 141.53 km/h.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":37,"text":"During the fifth hour, on lap 37, Chiron established a new lap record in 6m19s at an average speed of 141.53 km/h.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":42,"text":"Chiron's advantage to Borzacchini's Alfa Romeo was 1m47s after equaling his record lap of 6m19s on lap 42.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":42,"text":"Chiron's advantage to Borzacchini's Alfa Romeo was 1m47s after equaling his record lap of 6m19s on lap 42.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":45,"text":"On lap 45 Chiron had increased his lead to about four minutes.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":45,"text":"On lap 45 Chiron had increased his lead to about four minutes.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":46,"text":"Chiron's Bugatti is overdue; Borzacchini's Alfa Romeo flashes by and takes the lead.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":46,"text":"It was Chiron who explained that his car's magneto drive had sheared. He collected a magneto coupling and tools from his pit and set off sprinting to repair his stranded car.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":46,"text":"Chiron's Bugatti is overdue; Borzacchini's Alfa Romeo flashes by and takes the lead.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":46,"text":"It was Chiron who explained that his car's magneto drive had sheared. He collected a magneto coupling and tools from his pit and set off sprinting to repair his stranded car.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":52,"text":"At 3:15 PM an announcement was made that Chiron had retired.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":52,"text":"At around the same time, the Campari/Zehender Alfa Romeo retired.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":11},{"lap":52,"text":"At 3:15 PM an announcement was made that Chiron had retired.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":52,"text":"At around the same time, the Campari/Zehender Alfa Romeo retired.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":11},{"lap":54,"text":"Nuvolari leads Williams/Conelli by over four minutes and is told to slow down; Conelli creeps up.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":54,"text":"Nuvolari leads Williams/Conelli by over four minutes and is told to slow down; Conelli creeps up.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":62,"text":"After seven hours, 62 laps, Nuvolari held first place with 934.9 km at 133.6 km/h average speed, ahead of Conelli, Minoia, Birkin, Stoffel, Wimille and Pesato.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":62,"text":"After seven hours, 62 laps, Nuvolari held first place with 934.9 km at 133.6 km/h average speed, ahead of Conelli, Minoia, Birkin, Stoffel, Wimille and Pesato.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":73,"text":"During the ninth hour Conelli's Bugatti was brought in to refuel, change all wheels with brake drums in one piece, plus four sets of brake shoes, all done in the unbelievably short time of 2m02s.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":73,"text":"During the ninth hour Conelli's Bugatti was brought in to refuel, change all wheels with brake drums in one piece, plus four sets of brake shoes, all done in the unbelievably short time of 2m02s.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":74,"text":"Nuvolari pits to refuel and hand over to Borzacchini, who leaves with two minutes in hand.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":74,"text":"Nuvolari pits to refuel and hand over to Borzacchini, who leaves with two minutes in hand.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":80,"text":"Williams passes the Alfa Romeo for the lead.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":80,"text":"Williams passes the Alfa Romeo for the lead.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":82,"text":"During the tenth hour the Alfa Romeo stopped at the pits, where Borzacchini explained that he had fuel feed problems.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":82,"text":"During the tenth hour the Alfa Romeo stopped at the pits, where Borzacchini explained that he had fuel feed problems.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":83,"text":"Nuvolari came in the following lap to have the ignition coil replaced.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":83,"text":"Nuvolari came in the following lap to have the ignition coil replaced.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":86,"text":"Nuvolari finally caught up with Williams and passed him, but the Alfa Romeo was still one lap behind.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":86,"text":"In the meantime Wimille had abandoned with gearbox problems, the Pesato Alfa Romeo had been off the road and Ferdinand's Montier-Ford had retired.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":86,"text":"Nuvolari finally caught up with Williams and passed him, but the Alfa Romeo was still one lap behind.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":86,"text":"In the meantime Wimille had abandoned with gearbox problems, the Pesato Alfa Romeo had been off the road and Ferdinand's Montier-Ford had retired.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":88,"text":"At 7:00 PM Williams and Count Conelli Bugatti finished first, having covered 1320 km. Nuvolari and Borzacchini with the Alfa Romeo ended up second, over \u00be of a lap behind.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":88,"text":"Minoia and Minozzi wound up over 3 laps adrift in third place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":88,"text":"At 7:00 PM Williams and Count Conelli Bugatti finished first, having covered 1320 km. Nuvolari and Borzacchini with the Alfa Romeo ended up second, over \u00be of a lap behind.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":88,"text":"Minoia and Minozzi wound up over 3 laps adrift in third place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2}]}